 "notes": "The Haunted Harvest (server/README.md \"Haunted Harvest\"; pair 33 kit, ChaosHarvestArt.PAIR33): a cursed harvest village at night for levels 450-650, open only in the event's window (default October 25 to November 5) or when a gamemaster opens it. The Harvest Portals next to the temples lead to the crossroads (camp, Widow Hessa trades hollow candy); the exit portal leads to the temple. Pumpkin fields that grow and can be harvested, a corn maze, the hamlet of the hedge witches, the dead orchard, the gibbet hill, the graveyard whose graves burst open, and the ruined chapel with the crypt seal down to harvest_catacombs.json. The mechanics' items are placed at startup by harvest_event.lua from data/scripts/chaos/harvest_places.lua (server/tools/gen_harvest_places.py)."
